<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Florida Progress.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Florida Progress.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Bill Tilles downgraded Florida Progress Corp to neutral from outperform, his office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 7/8 to 28-5/8.</p>
</text>
